   "title": "Foreign tourist arrivals in Korea estimated to have set annual record early",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/20261027/foreign-tourist-arrivals-in-korea-estimated-to-have-set-annual-record-early",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
