   "title": "Woman sentenced to 10-month prison term for spitting at police officer at election rally",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/law-crime/20261027/woman-sentenced-to-10-month-prison-term-for-spitting-at-police-officer-at-election-rally",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
   "source": "koreatimes.co.kr",
   "published": "Tue, 27 Oct 2026 08:37:02 GMT",
   "_dt": 1793090222.0,
   "ageDays": 0.02,
   "summary": "A court on Tuesday sentenced a woman to 10 months in prison for spitting at a police officer and assaulting others during rallies to protest ballot shortages in June's local elections. The 45-year-old, surnamed Kim, was accused of assaulting a total of five people, including the police officer who was trying to restrain her, during rallies outside the Olympic Park Handball Gymnasium in southeastern Seoul on June 22 and 23.",
   "summary_zh": "周二，一家法院判处一名女子10个月监禁，原因是她在抗议6月地方选举选票短缺的集会期间向警察吐口水并袭击他人。这名45岁的女子姓金，被控在6月22日和23日于首尔东南部奥林匹克公园手球馆外的集会上袭击5人，其中包括试图制止她的警察。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "A court on Tuesday sentenced a woman to 10 months in prison for spitting at a police officer and assaulting others during rallies to protest ballot shortages in June's local elections. The 45-year-old, surnamed Kim, was accused of assaulting a total of five people, including the police officer who was trying to restrain her, during rallies outside the Olympic Park Handball Gymnasium in southeastern Seoul on June 22 and 23. The Seoul Eastern District Court convicted her of obstruction of official duties and sentenced her to prison, citing her history of repeated assault and other offenses since February, as well as concerns she may reoffend. It also cited favorable factors in determining the level of punishment, including the fact that Kim admitted to her crimes, showed remorse and was diagnosed with bipolar disorder in 2024",
