   "title": "Investigation body chief attends Cabinet meeting for 2nd time amid controversy",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/politics/20261027/investigation-body-chief-attends-cabinet-meeting-for-2nd-time-amid-controversy",
