   "title": "Budget ministry to start early review of 2028 spending cuts",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/politics/20261026/budget-ministry-to-start-early-review-of-2028-spending-cuts",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
