   "snippet": "Let it be on the record: Buhari birthed this project from start to finish.\n\nGroundbreaking & physical work started in 2021.\n\nBuhari kept it alive with $318M in direct FG cash when the lender, China EXIM Bank, stalled and backed out due to post-COVID adjustments. \n\nBefore leaving office in May 2023, Buhari restructured the financing to secure the €245M from China Development Bank loan with the 9th Senate. \n\nTinubu can't claim this project.",
